diagram Cell変換・条件分岐・複数Cellの参照
time_end 4
layout auto

stream input events 1:10, 2:20, 3:30, 4:40
cell blocked = false changes 1:true, 3:false
map enabled = not
cell count = 2 changes 1:3, 2:4
map doubled = mul 2
cell offset = 5
gate allowed
snapshot total cells 2 = add
sink out

blocked -> enabled
count -> doubled
input -> allowed.event
enabled -> allowed.gate
allowed -> total.event
doubled -> total.c1
offset -> total.c2
total -> out
